DeltaKind is a fan project based on and modifying the Kristal engine.

This repository is intended primarily for development and convenience.
It is not intended as a distribution of the DeltaKind source code.

The original Kristal engine and its components remain subject to their
original licenses and copyrights.

The DeltaKind-specific code and assets are not licensed for redistribution,
modification, or use in other projects without permission from the copyright holder.
